                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Got this game because I got a coupon from completing a badge, and since it was crazy cheap, I decided to get the game.\n\nOnly problem is that it's less of a game, and really just slop mashed together to create a walking simulator with guns. The enemies are... underwhelming to say the least, and I couldn't bother refunding this game. \n\nIt's going to raise your completed games count, to say the least, so if you want to just bulk up on the number of completed games, I would recommend this game, but if you're looking for something worthwhile, this isn't the right game to purchase.",
